## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

This is a fully hand-written "list" data source (not generated by
`tfplugingen-framework`, which has no such concept) wrapping
`GET /sources/v1/{sourceId}/schemas` (`api_beta.SourcesAPIService.GetSourceSchemas`),
mirroring `identitynow_roles_v1`'s established pattern. It reuses
`identitynow_source_schema_v1`'s generated schema/model types for each
list element - see that resource's "Known Limitations & Live Testing
Notes" section for the full rationale on the CSV-endpoint exclusion and
`configuration` JSON-string modeling, which apply identically to every
schema returned here. Phase B (live testing against a real sandbox tenant)
is pending for the same reason noted there.
